   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JAM Kvalitetsinfrastruktu</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JAM National Quality Prog - JAM National Quality Pro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the national quality infrastructure in Jamaica. Project started in the Jamaican Bureau of Standards and was  transfered to the ministry of industry, technology, energy and commerce. Implementing swedish agency was SWEDAC.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Utveckling ett nationellt kvalitetssystem i enlighet med internationella principer f&#xf6;r kvalitetss&#xe4;kring som ska antas och implementeras. Jamaicansk part Ministeriet f&#xf6;r industri, teknologi, energi och handel samt delpart Bureau of Standards och svensk konsult SWEDAC.</narrative>
  </description>
